$ 固定，$T,T^*,T^{**}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L$。\n$\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L$ 见 [[17-df-model-companion]]，$\\operatorname{Mod}$ 见 [[17-df-model]]。\n证明使用 [[17-lem-universal-consequences-extension]] 的延拓及 [[17-thm-elementary-chain-union]] 的初等链定理。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-model-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"59d623a1692279f1","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"一致性约定：原书印刷 p.186（DjVu 202）的模型完全性定义限于一致理论；本条沿用 [[17-df-model-completeness]] 的本地谓词，保留不一致时的空真延拓。故来源对应在一致理论上按原书理解；不一致边界由模型类为空另行核对，不把该延拓冒称原书定义。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"L","display":false},{"tex":"T,T^*,T^{**}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Mod}","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L(T^*,T)\\land\n\\operatorname{ModelCompanion}_L(T^{**},T)\\bigr)\n\\ \\longrightarrow\\\n\\operatorname{Mod}(T^*)=\\operatorname{Mod}(T^{**}).","display":true},{"tex":"T^*","display":false},{"tex":"T^{**}","display":false},{"tex":"T^*","display":false},{"tex":"T^{**}","display":false},{"tex":"T^*","display":false}],"bytes":2272,"backlinks":[{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-195","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-thm-aleph-one-categoricity-consequences]]\n[[17-thm-atomic-model-existence]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability]]\n[[17-thm-beth-definability-satisfaction-form]]\n[[17-thm-chain-sentence-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-chain-theory-preservation]]\n[[17-thm-compactness]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-equivalents]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-henkin-form]]\n[[17-thm-compactness-ultraproduct-form]]\n[[17-thm-completeness-characterization]]\n[[17-thm-countable-back-and-forth]]\n[[17-thm-countable-omitting-types]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation]]\n[[17-thm-craig-interpolation-common-language]]\n[[17-thm-dense-linear-order-qe]]\n[[17-thm-diagram-embedding]]\n[[17-thm-downward-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-thm-ehrenfeucht-mostowski]]\n[[17-thm-